murasaki (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=low

  * The package has a long description.
  * The Plasma wallpaper plugin's QML module is installed in Qt's QML
    directory, stripped, instead of under /usr/share.
  * The post-install message only suggests enabling murasaki-surface (the
    daemon is started by D-Bus).

